- op: discuss  # b245
  at: '2026-02-26T23:51:59Z'  # b245
  by: agent  # b245
  actor: jgstern_agent  # b245
  clock: 10  # b245
  nonce: b245  # b245
  message: "Yes, documentation is up-to-date: AGENTS.md documents both bakeoff-features (DEEP) and bakeoff (BROAD) commands, and CHANGELOG.md covers the status/compare/active subcommands. The reflect_statuses fix applies to DEEP mode only (bakeoff-features-reflect). BROAD mode uses a separate bakeoff-reflect script with its own state tracking. The autonomous-mode-active-but-no-bakeoff scenario is handled: the stop hook's bakeoff convergence section simply shows nothing if no bakeoff session exists — the guidance focuses on tracker items and priority queue instead."  # b245
